{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "36ef2717-1888-8a7a-b5f8-a706c3860d1d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T10:55:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anabela Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Newport Recreation, this is Beth. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Beth, good morning. My name's Anabela Spencer. I'm calling about the winter basketball for the kids, the youth league. Is it still taking sign-ups?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, yes. We've got registration open for the winter session. Are you looking to sign up one child or more than one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the one. My nephew, he's staying with me and he's been bouncing a ball off every wall in the apartment, so I figure it's time he had somewhere to put it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, we can fix that. How old is he?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:50:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He just turned nine. Is that okay? I wasn't sure what the age limits were. I thought maybe it starts at ten or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:08-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nine is fine. The youth program usually runs in age groups, so he'd go in with the younger division. Let me pull up the sheet so I give you the right cutoffs. One sec."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time. I'm in no rush. I'm just sitting in the car outside the market."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:31-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the younger division is for the elementary-age kids, and then there's an older group for middle schoolers. A nine-year-old lands right in the younger one. If he were going to be older than the top of that range by the start of the session we'd move him up, but he's well inside it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:51:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh good. And what about the older group, what's the top age on that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:52:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That one goes up through the middle school years. High schoolers have a different setup, so he'd be a long way from that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:52:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, perfect. He'd be thrilled. So how do I sign him up? Do I come down there or can I do it over the phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:52:22-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take the registration right now over the phone. I'll need his full name, his birthday, and a phone number for you. And there's a registration confirmation number I'll read you at the end so you've got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:52:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hang on, let me find a pen. I've got a receipt here, I'll write on the back. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:52:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "First, his name and birthday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:52:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mateus Spencer, M-A-T-E-U-S. Birthday is November the fourth, he was born in, um, twenty sixteen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:52:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:53:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:53:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-six. Perfect. Okay, he's all set in the system. Your confirmation number is seven-four-one-two-eight-five-nine-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:53:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Seven-four-one-two-eight-five-nine-three. Wait, no, let me say it back. Seven-four-one-two-five-eight-nine-three. That right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:53:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Close, but you flipped a couple in the middle. It's seven-four-one-two, then eight-five, then nine-three. Eight before five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:53:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, eight-five, not five-eight. Okay. Seven-four-one-two-eight-five-nine-three. Got it, I fixed it on the receipt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:53:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. You've got it exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:53:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'd have been down there with the wrong number and you'd all have looked at me funny."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:53:42-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happens all the time, don't worry. Now, the practices and games are held at the gym, and the schedule will come out before the session starts. We'll send it to the number you gave me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:53:57-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's wonderful. And is everything all right with the gym after that storm? It ended Saturday, I think, and it was wicked windy down the Point. I just wondered if anything got messed up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:54:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "As far as I know we're running as normal. If anything changes with the schedule we'll call you. I'd keep an eye on your phone the first week just in case."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:54:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Does he need anything special, like sneakers, or does he bring his own ball?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:54:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Non-marking sneakers for the gym floor, and a water bottle. We supply the balls and the team shirts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:54:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's easy. He's got sneakers he's wrecked everything else in, so one more pair won't hurt. Well, thank you, Beth, you've been so nice. This made my morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:54:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy to help, Anabela. Tell Mateus we said welcome to the team. Have a great day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:55:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, hon. Bye bye now."
    }
  ],
